# Installed at /srv/gha-runner/config/shared-images.list on exedore (a276).
# The images gha-images-warm keeps in the shared read-only store, one per
# line. Taken from the org's workflows and FROM lines on 2026-11-18: the gate
# images at the tags workflows run, and the Hummingbird Python bases our
# Containerfiles build from (counts are Containerfiles using each).
# Only the warm timer writes the store; jobs read it and cannot change it.
